<h1>About This Project</h1>
<p>
    The <strong>Student Record Management System</strong> is a mini project built to demonstrate
    the core concepts of ASP.NET MVC on the .NET Framework, including:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>MVC architecture (Models, Views, Controllers)</li>
    <li>Routing and navigation between pages</li>
    <li>Razor view syntax and shared layouts</li>
    <li>Form handling with model validation (Data Annotations)</li>
    <li>Basic CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)</li>
</ul>
<p>
    Data is stored in-memory for simplicity, so it resets whenever the application restarts.
    This can easily be replaced with Entity Framework and a SQL Server database for persistence.
</p>
